{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 支援社群論壇由星期二起停止接受新帖，整個網站將於 11 月 20 日關閉。Apple 未提供關閉原因。</p>\n<h2>論壇關閉或涉 Reddit 與 LLM</h2>\n<p>論壇關閉的可能原因，與 Reddit、Discord 等社群平台興起，以及 LLM 應用普及有關。Apple Support 亦使用人工智能解析查詢。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Apple-Store-Front.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:42.978189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:34:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:34.820183+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:20.743480+00:00","content_hash":"b528bec0c97aba4f8ca09fdc8a5a22c0fc98e9aa34807faf325aa925cbdfdf9e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}